                                "sense_id": "da2924af-3bdb-3dcd-9bc1-4c1b72c085a6",
                                "text": "1640 (first published), Ben Jonson, An Epistle to a friend to persuade him to join the wars\nAnd pursues the dice with glassen eyes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a1575d7-8831-4a4b-b75c-7be6bcaa3450",
                                "sense_id": "da2924af-3bdb-3dcd-9bc1-4c1b72c085a6",
                                "text": "Abreast of the players, he jumped down, seized one of the taws - it was a glassen alley - knuckled down, fired kibby at the clayers in the ring, and was back in his seat before you could cry \"Jack Robinson\"."
